  "caption_latex": "Independent continuous-feedback trajectory check at the weak-end setting of main Fig.~2. {(a):} Connected endpoint correlation $G_{13}^{yy}$. {(b):} Connected endpoint correlation $G_{13}^{zz}$. {(c):} Fixed Bell-state fidelity $F_{\\Phi^+}$, with the entanglement threshold $1/2$ indicated. {(d):} Concurrence $\\mathcal C_{13}$ of the averaged endpoint state. Each panel compares the conditioned coefficient hierarchy (purple dashed) with the master equation (teal solid), both at total photon cap three. Shading gives approximate pointwise 95\\% intervals from 256 resamples of sixteen independent blocks containing 512 records in total; connected products and concurrence are recomputed after averaging each resample. {A leave-one-block-out correction removes the leading product bias of connected moments.} These trajectories use $\\omega_c\\dd t=0.0025$ and are distinct from the unmonitored HOPS ensembles of main Fig.~1.",
  "presentation_revision": "Approved lightness-separated palette, 2026-10-29. Original scientific markers retained; no additional decorative markers."
